&lt;p&gt;This is an excellent opportunity to work alongside our established team who will support you to utilise and enhance your advisory and insolvency skills and experience.&amp;nbsp;You will work alongside some of the most experienced practitioners in the field advising the boards, management teams, lenders and shareholders of companies which are underperforming and/or facing any financial stress.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our North team has recently led a number of high profile regional insolvencies (including the Black Sheep Brewery, WN VTech and TXM Plant Administrations), as well as working on complex and challenging advisory assignments&amp;nbsp; We work with a full spectrum of companies from SME to PLC.&lt;/p&gt;
